3. dgx-spark-networking
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Repository: https://github.com/christopherowen/dgx-spark-networking
Forum reference: https://forums.developer.nvidia.com/t/dgx-spark-networking-open-source-switchless-roce-collectives-nccl-profiles-and-fabric-tooling-for-multi-spark-inference/385049
Author: Christopher Owen (@christopher_owen)
License: Apache License, Version 2.0

Attribution:
- Packaged b12x's RoCEnante one-shot collective engine (sparknet.oneshot) with
  dual-backend payload-size dispatch (routing decode-sized payloads <= 2 MiB to
  RoCEnante one-shot RDMA and larger prefill payloads > 2 MiB to dual-rail NCCL),
  dual-rail ConnectX-7 HCA discovery on GB10 (rocep1s0f0/rocep1s0f1 and
  roceP2p1s0f0/roceP2p1s0f1), fabric doctor / collective verification tooling,
  and documentation of the AArch64 NCCL send-path memory-ordering fix
  (NVIDIA/nccl#2393 by Stanislav Bardyuk). These directly informed
  crates/sparkflash-comm/src/dispatch.rs, crates/sparkflash-comm/src/fabric.rs,
  and crates/sparkflash-cli/src/doctor.rs.

